00:10:41.175 --> 00:10:42.375
>> Well, we're doing.

00:10:42.775 --> 00:10:46.775
We're still providing the services that we've been providing for quite a while,

00:10:47.175 --> 00:10:49.495
but we are getting very, very stretched.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:11:00.940
Some members of the board were on the board a couple of years ago and we had an informal meet and greet about things and things have not improved much since then as far as recruitment.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:06.300
Our retention is good. We're keeping a lot of the older members that we have, but unfortunately older is the key word.

00:11:07.815 --> 00:11:15.975
We're going to try after the first of the year, try another big recruitment drive in town again to see if after the holidays because everybody's got too much in their place right now.

00:11:18.135 --> 00:11:18.855
It's

00:11:19.735 --> 00:11:21.175
hard. People can't juggle

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:31.200
the amount of training and stuff that's involved with this with volunteering in the fire department and their day to day lifestyle of making a living and paying their bills with with

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:36.480
The United States and the shape it's in and the cost of fuel and food and everything else. So,

00:11:37.195 --> 00:11:48.875
I mean, it's very, very hard to get new people interested and to put the time and effort into what it takes to actually be trained and certified to do something. EMT classes running almost two hundred hours, firefighter

00:11:48.875 --> 00:11:50.315
classes one hundred and eighty hours.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:55.030
And the cost of it is quite substantial for both of those two.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:55.990
So

00:11:56.550 --> 00:12:03.030
it's very tough right now recruiting. We're not the only ones with a problem. I mean, is a nationwide problem, not just the man over Connecticut problem.

00:12:04.955 --> 00:12:07.035
But other than that, the fire department is doing

00:12:07.435 --> 00:12:09.035
fairly good with what we have.

00:12:10.315 --> 00:12:12.475
Equipment wise, we're in good shape.

00:12:14.795 --> 00:12:19.515
