00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:29.830
There's really no major purchases coming for the next couple of years. Our next big purchase would be the refurbishment of ET115

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:31.910
or the replacement of that truck.

00:12:33.005 --> 00:12:42.845
Right now, it's at the twenty six year mark and the NFPA recommends twenty five years as we did with ET215 and we were able to get another twelve years out of that truck when we refurbished that truck.

00:12:43.325 --> 00:12:43.965
So,

00:12:44.365 --> 00:12:46.845
I mean, at some point we that will come

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.750
to light as to whether or not

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:49.870
the

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:53.070
value of refurbishing it is worth

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:59.950
just going out and replacing the truck, depending on the cost and that cost never goes down either. It just goes up and up and up.

00:13:02.335 --> 00:13:02.895
But

00:13:03.375 --> 00:13:04.735
as far as like

00:13:05.695 --> 00:13:10.815
the members we have, they're getting out, they're doing the job. Sometimes we're a little shorthanded for sure.

00:13:11.855 --> 00:13:15.055
But we got a good group of people that are getting things done for us.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:18.590
Other than that, I don't

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:20.270
really know

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:28.830
what the board can actually do to help unless you got a bunch of people that you can rope into volunteering and send them our way.

00:13:30.555 --> 00:13:41.915
