00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:42.955
it's a miracle.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:49.860
Last year we got one guy that joined and he went through the firefighter class to get certified as firefighter.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:54.980
But he's, now that he's done that work, he's also, he's got a young family

00:13:55.300 --> 00:14:03.075
and he's struggling with balancing work his family life in the fire department. So, it's not an easy task, that's for sure.

00:14:07.555 --> 00:14:17.410
Well, any just. Do have any questions? I mean, pertaining to anything in particular because like I said, I really don't have a lot other than the fact that, know, we're getting the job done still.

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:19.890
>> Well,

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:21.650
just from the

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:27.970
from my end, I greatly appreciate everything you and the members of the fire department do for the town.

00:14:28.825 --> 00:14:30.665
It is greatly appreciated.

