And we're going to have to start thinking outside of the box as to what we can do to try to help

00:14:36.265 --> 00:14:36.985
improve

00:14:37.305 --> 00:14:38.425
your recruitment.

00:14:41.305 --> 00:14:55.490
>> So... Yeah, like, you know, like I said, Jeff, mean, that's a national problem recruitment and stuff like that. And, you know, like, I hate to say it because it's an ugly word, but a lot of departments are around the country, not just Connecticut area are starting to go to combination departments,

00:14:56.105 --> 00:15:03.865
where they have paid staff certain hours of the day or only a couple of paid staff and then they require volunteers to show up the rest of the time. I mean,

00:15:05.065 --> 00:15:08.745
it's something that's coming down road here. Unfortunately,

00:15:08.825 --> 00:15:14.750
it may be coming sooner than later if we can't find younger people to take the spots of the older people we have.

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:17.870
Like I said, we're

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:22.510
doing our best to try to get people in the door, but it's just tough for people to juggle

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:27.975
families, economy and the amount of time that it takes to do what you got to do here.

00:15:28.695 --> 00:15:35.335
So it's one of those things that I wish there was an easier way and an easy solution to it, but there really isn't.

